sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant ES as EditorState (gpui-component)
    participant SEV as SourceEditorView
    participant Eng as Engine
    participant App as AppState
    participant Views
    User->>ES: Types
    ES-->>SEV: InputEvent::Change
    SEV->>SEV: Diff widget text against engine rope<br/>(common prefix/suffix, editor/sync.rs)
    SEV->>Eng: edit.insert_text / edit.replace_range
    activate Eng
    Note over Eng: Engine::apply_edits<br/>1. Rope edit, version bump<br/>2. adoc-parser re-parse<br/>3. Index replace<br/>4. Diagnostics refresh for open documents<br/>5. Undo entry (typing coalesces within 500 ms)
    Eng-->>App: DocumentChanged, DiagnosticsUpdated
    deactivate Eng
    App-->>Views: Re-emit as GPUI events
    Views->>Views: Re-render
    Note over Eng,SEV: Engine-originated changes (undo, replace, rename)<br/>flow back, and the widget is reconciled with one replacement
